    "description": {
      "value": "The Lung Bloodstone of Arazni represents suffering. While you carry the Lung Bloodstone, you gain the ability to turn your pain into a weapon against your enemies. You allow the pain to resonate within you, making you stronger. You gain a +1 status bonus to your next Strike or spell attack before the end of your next turn. You point your finger at a creature within 60 feet that has wronged you, and you verbally admonish them. The creature takes 1d4 mental damage for every level you have (basic Will save against your class DC). On a failed save, the creature is also stunned 1 (stunned 3 on a critical failure)."
    },
